>
  <p>A good patio turns the backyard into usable living space, and concrete is the practical way to build it. It is durable, low-maintenance and cost-effective compared to most other materials, and it handles patio furniture, grills and freeze-thaw winters without complaint. <a href="/">Concrete Toronto</a> designs and pours concrete patios across Toronto and the GTA.</p>

  <p>The two things that decide how a patio ages are the base and the slope. We excavate, compact a granular base, and grade the surface so water runs away from the house. Skip either one and you get pooling water in summer and heaving slabs in winter. We do not skip either one.</p>

  <h2>What's included in our concrete patio service</h2>
  <p>Every patio job is priced as a complete package in a written quote:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Design and layout</strong> based on how you use the yard, with measurements and material selection</li>
    <li><strong>Excavation and a compacted granular base</strong> built for freeze-thaw conditions</li>
    <li><strong>Proper slope</strong> so meltwater and rain drain away from your foundation</li>
    <li><strong>Forms, pour and finish</strong>, broom texture or smooth trowel where you want it</li>
    <li><strong>Control joints</strong> placed to manage natural shrinkage</li>
    <li><strong>Full cleanup</strong> and clear curing guidance before we leave</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Pair it with the rest of the yard</h2>
  <p>A patio rarely stands alone. Most of our patio jobs connect to a <a href="/services/concrete-walkways/">walkway</a>, a set of <a href="/services/concrete-steps/">steps</a> down from a door, or a fresh look at the <a href="/services/parging/">foundation wall</a> behind it. Because our crew handles all of it, you get one quote, one schedule and one cleanup instead of coordinating three trades.</p>

  <h2>Why homeowners choose us</h2>
  <p>15 years of concrete work across Toronto means we have seen every yard shape and soil condition the city offers. We give you a straight recommendation, a written price, and a schedule we stick to.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>2-year warranty on every pour</li>
    <li>Satisfaction guaranteed</li>
    <li>Free, no-obligation quotes</li>
  </ul>

  <p>Not sure what size or finish fits your yard? Send the form with a rough idea and we will talk it through during the consultation. We work across the GTA: see our <a href="/locations/">service areas</a>.</p>
